  "mythologicalStory": "Abhijit literally means 'The Victorious One'. Ancient Vedic scriptures describe it as an extremely auspicious Nakshatra associated with Lord Brahma and divine victory. Although later traditions standardized the 27 Nakshatra system for birth astrology, Abhijit continued to hold great importance in Muhurta Shastra. It symbolizes success, purity, divine blessings and the triumph of dharma over adversity.",

