    "Forms the basis of the famous Abhijit Muhurta.",
    "Mentioned in several ancient Vedic texts.",
    "Not used for Vimshottari Dasha calculations.",
    "Not assigned as a Janma Nakshatra in the standard 27 Nakshatra system."
